*.PININFO IN:I OUT:O CLKN:B CLK:B VDD:B VSS:B
M1 IN CLK OUT VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=1u nf=1 m=1
M2 IN CLKN OUT VDD pfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=2u nf=1 m=1
.ends


